# Configuration lives in the shared file — see **`../.env.example`** (microservices/.env.example).
#
# Quick start:
#   cp ../.env.example ../.env
#   nano ../.env
#
# If **`microservices/.env`** exists, **`src/config.ts`** loads it automatically. Otherwise this
# service falls back to **`<auth-service>/.env`**.
